+.Dd November 7, 2026
+.Dt STDNORETURN 3
+.Os
+.Sh NAME
+.Nm stdnoreturn
+.Nd non-returning function specifier
+.Sh SYNOPSIS
+.In stdnoreturn.h
+.Fn noreturn "function declaration"
+.Sh DESCRIPTION
+The
+.In stdnoreturn.h
+header defines the
+.Fn noreturn
+macro, which expands to the
+.Va _Noreturn
+function specifier.
+A function declared with it does not return to its caller and must not be
+called in a context that expects it to.
+.Pp
+The macro is intended for C only.
+In C++ the equivalent facility is the
+.Va [[noreturn]]
+attribute, and the header defines nothing.
+.Pp
