+.Fn call_once "once_flag *flag" "void (*func)(void)"
+.Sh DESCRIPTION
+The
+.In threads.h
+header provides the ISO C11 threads interface.
+It is a standardised interface over the
+.Xr pthreads 3
+implementation.
+The lifecycle functions and these wrappers are supplied by libpthread;
+some pthread synchronization primitives are implemented in libc.
+Programs using this interface must be compiled and linked with
+.Fl pthread .
+Every object is a real pthread object underneath and no separate
+synchronisation primitive is introduced.
+.Pp
+.Fn thrd_create
+creates a thread that runs
+.Fa func
+with argument
+.Fa arg .
+.Fn thrd_join
